 "edits": [
  "stage 38 (candidate 23, 2026-10-15): PS1 removed (deleted part, no heat row); PS2 mpn IRM-20-24 -> MPM-20-24 (same Case 219A footprint, pose and body). The rest is the stage-19b extraction unchanged; a full re-extraction on the s38 board also picks up later MPN changes of other lanes (U1/U2, R10/R12/R18/R20, R39, bank grade) and is left to the B3 owner.",
